Cell["\<\
A register of one block is the identity on everything \[LongDash] same \
generators, same label matrix, same circuits \[LongDash] which is what keeps \
the rest of the layer unaffected by this object existing.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"2ef71510-aa09-eca9-568c-8d5dcfbdb6f3"],

Cell["\<\
The gate between blocks is the transversal CNOT: qubit by qubit, so each \
qubit of one block touches exactly the corresponding qubit of the other and \
nothing else. That is the property that stops a single fault from spreading \
inside either block.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"3343f580-98d5-e31c-6170-ecea1961ce66"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"reg", "[", 
  RowBox[{"\"\<TransversalCNOT\>\"", ",", " ", "1", ",", " ", "2"}], 
  "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->
  "In[24]:= ",ExpressionUUID->"20a7420b-376a-b23f-505d-6455421c0105"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"{", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{"\<\"CNOT\"\>", ",", "1", ",", "8"}], "}"}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{"\<\"CNOT\"\>", ",", "2", ",", "9"}], "}"}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{"\<\"CNOT\"\>", ",", "3", ",", "10"}], "}"}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{"\<\"CNOT\"\>", ",", "4", ",", "11"}], "}"}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{"\<\"CNOT\"\>", ",", "5", ",", "12"}], "}"}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{"\<\"CNOT\"\>", ",", "6", ",", "13"}], "}"}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{"\<\"CNOT\"\>", ",", "7", ",", "14"}], "}"}]}], "}"}]], "Output",
 CellLabel->
  "Out[24]= ",ExpressionUUID->"6af863a9-1098-c609-1a98-7af3a112ad53"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell["\<\
Steane EC was already resting on this being the logical CNOT. Here it is \
computed, by conjugating the logical operators through the gate and reading \
the images off:\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"055bc2ad-6b92-a3be-3378-dbf70e24f184"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"reg", "[", 
  RowBox[{"\"\<LogicalAction\>\"", ",", " ", "1", ",", " ", "2"}], 
  "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->
  "In[25]:= ",ExpressionUUID->"2b0fb60e-2211-365f-5934-286857a59ca5"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"\[LeftAssociation]", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{"\<\"X\"\>", ",", "1", ",", "1"}], "}"}], 
    "\[Rule]", "\<\"IIXIXXIIIXIXXI\"\>"}], ",", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{"\<\"X\"\>", ",", "2", ",", "1"}], "}"}], 
    "\[Rule]", "\<\"IIIIIIIIIXIXXI\"\>"}], ",", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{"\<\"Z\"\>", ",", "1", ",", "1"}], "}"}], 
    "\[Rule]", "\<\"IZIZIZIIIIIIII\"\>"}], ",", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{"\<\"Z\"\>", ",", "2", ",", "1"}], "}"}], 
    "\[Rule]", "\<\"IZIZIZIIZIZIZI\"\>"}]}], 
  "\[RightAssociation]"}]], "Output",
 CellLabel->
  "Out[25]= ",ExpressionUUID->"201a2509-bdd9-2fa1-5039-bd53346c758b"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Read as logical operators: ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox[
     OverscriptBox[
      StyleBox["X", "TI"], "_"], "1"], "\[Rule]", 
    SubscriptBox[
     OverscriptBox[
      StyleBox["X", "TI"], "_"], "1"], 
    SubscriptBox[
     OverscriptBox[
      StyleBox["X", "TI"], "_"], "2"]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "7085d256-6adc-aa08-20ba-d4100f6ef952"],
 " (the image spans both blocks), ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox[
     OverscriptBox[
      StyleBox["X", "TI"], "_"], "2"], "\[Rule]", 
    SubscriptBox[
     OverscriptBox[
      StyleBox["X", "TI"], "_"], "2"]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "5f932952-49a5-d34f-05a0-c11c6851a195"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox[
     OverscriptBox[
      StyleBox["Z", "TI"], "_"], "1"], "\[Rule]", 
    SubscriptBox[
     OverscriptBox[
      StyleBox["Z", "TI"], "_"], "1"]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "160f17c4-d31a-fe19-3e34-8ea1e6acc563"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox[
     OverscriptBox[
      StyleBox["Z", "TI"], "_"], "2"], "\[Rule]", 
    SubscriptBox[
     OverscriptBox[
      StyleBox["Z", "TI"], "_"], "1"], 
    SubscriptBox[
     OverscriptBox[
      StyleBox["Z", "TI"], "_"], "2"]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "10beb8bd-bdb6-ee93-4045-31e73440b4f9"],
 ". That is the action of a CNOT on the logical pair."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"3fdc991b-fead-14b0-65e3-1144fb587e9a"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "On the five-qubit code the same gate does something else, and ",
 StyleBox["how", "TI"],
 " it fails is worth keeping in mind: the ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   StyleBox["Z", "TI"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "3657d2c5-05c0-ac85-5e6c-cbafac7af6ef"],
 " half of the action still comes out right and only the ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   StyleBox["X", "TI"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "0642d375-09f3-9942-2e71-cb3faf87eba8"],
 " half breaks, so a check that looked only at the logical operators would \
have passed half the time. What decides is whether the gate maps the \
stabilizer group to itself \[LongDash] the next section's question."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"0651775d-2bad-791b-2e6f-6f074e584861"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "5. ",
 Cell[BoxData["QECTransversalGate"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "63b9e3d6-2298-231e-1146-fa9057128e64"],
 " \[LongDash] the gates a code performs for free"
}], "Section",ExpressionUUID->"67c13665-f813-2f11-0dfe-a84ef9a6727b"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "A gate applied to every qubit of a block separately cannot spread one fault \
into two, so transversal gates are the cheapest fault-tolerant gates there \
are. Which ones a code admits is a question about the ",
 StyleBox["symmetry", "TI"],
 " of its stabilizer: ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["U", "TI"], 
    RowBox[{"\[CircleTimes]", 
     StyleBox["n", "TI"]}]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "4c440104-ea8a-4285-747b-99618f3f10ef"],
 " is a valid gadget exactly when it maps the stabilizer group to itself, and \
the logical gate you get is whatever it does to ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   OverscriptBox[
    StyleBox["X", "TI"], "_"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "66c9a615-af45-c085-0ef6-385ecaf192ef"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   OverscriptBox[
    StyleBox["Z", "TI"], "_"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "0513e607-0f4c-1e20-3320-f861aaf9650a"],
 "."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"0371ff35-cd30-cda2-310e-f77ee4ca9788"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"QECTransversalGate", "[", 
   RowBox[{"steane", ",", " ", "\"\<H\>\""}], "]"}], 
  "[", "\"\<LogicalAction\>\"", "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->
  "In[26]:= ",ExpressionUUID->"6833ae6a-6ac5-a2c8-19c0-40340f71f012"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"\[LeftAssociation]", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{"\<\"X\"\>", ",", "1"}], "}"}], "\[Rule]", "\<\"Z\"\>"}], ",", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{"\<\"Z\"\>", ",", "1"}], "}"}], "\[Rule]", "\<\"X\"\>"}]}], 
  "\[RightAssociation]"}]], "Output",
 CellLabel->
  "Out[26]= ",ExpressionUUID->"5f7f2999-1aee-25a5-0504-c0c39e988f8f"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Transversal Hadamard, logical Hadamard (eq. 11.18\[Dash]11.19). Now the \
same question for ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   StyleBox["S", "TI"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "128c7526-c883-085d-42b4-6c83e9365aa7"],
 ":"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"3279c00f-c9e2-8758-6206-da68ef94eda2"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"Module", "[", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{"g", " ", "=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"QECTransversalGate", "[", 
      RowBox[{"steane", ",", " ", "\"\<S\>\""}], "]"}]}], "}"}], ",", "\n", 
   "    ", 
   RowBox[{"<|", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"\"\<transversal\>\"", " ", "->", " ", 
      RowBox[{"g", "[", "\"\<TransversalQ\>\"", "]"}]}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"\"\<action\>\"", " ", "->", " ", 
      RowBox[{"g", "[", "\"\<LogicalAction\>\"", "]"}]}], ",", "\n", "      ", 
     RowBox[{"\"\<logical gate\>\"", " ", "->", " ", 
      RowBox[{"g", "[", "\"\<LogicalGate\>\"", "]"}]}]}], "|>"}]}], 
  "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->
  "In[27]:= ",ExpressionUUID->"50b12ff8-e606-85f7-004e-c6a593b0efdd"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"\[LeftAssociation]", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"\<\"transversal\"\>", "\[Rule]", "True"}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"\<\"action\"\>", "\[Rule]", 
    RowBox[{"\[LeftAssociation]", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{"\<\"X\"\>", ",", "1"}], "}"}], "\[Rule]", "\<\"-Y\"\>"}], ",", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{"\<\"Z\"\>", ",", "1"}], "}"}], "\[Rule]", "\<\"Z\"\>"}]}], 
     "\[RightAssociation]"}]}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"\<\"logical gate\"\>", "\[Rule]", "\<\"Sdg\"\>"}]}], 
  "\[RightAssociation]"}]], "Output",
 CellLabel->
  "Out[27]= ",ExpressionUUID->"640f47a5-4648-c62d-0c35-5e0f73e2ad77"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["A minus sign, and it is a different gate.",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    OverscriptBox[
     StyleBox["X", "TI"], "_"], "\[Rule]", "-", 
    OverscriptBox[
     StyleBox["Y", "TI"], "_"]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "63a48922-0fac-666c-115b-208caa594cb6"],
 " with ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   OverscriptBox[
    StyleBox["Z", "TI"], "_"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "387a9e0d-0234-0e73-6819-1057b7c15559"],
 " fixed is the action of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["S", "TI"], "\[Dagger]"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "3f64ca0d-9927-5f44-651b-ec5718d225ae"],
 ": the transversal ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   StyleBox["S", "TI"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "399d1ff3-4632-be92-6fa2-96bd73c404f8"],
 " performs the ",
 StyleBox["inverse", "TI"],
 " of the gate it is made of. The sign is one line of Pauli algebra:"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"1170384d-2f38-2c50-470f-b2174acd76ba"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"(", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"QECPauli", "[", "\"\<XXXXXXX\>\"", "]"}], " ", "**", " ", 
    RowBox[{"QECPauli", "[", "\"\<ZZZZZZZ\>\"", "]"}]}], ")"}], 
  "[", "\"\<String\>\"", "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->
  "In[28]:= ",ExpressionUUID->"6ce33075-6d34-44a7-1490-aa3f04c12e8d"],

Cell[BoxData["\<\"iYYYYYYY\"\>"], "Output",
 CellLabel->
  "Out[28]= ",ExpressionUUID->"54e2b6d5-0ba4-5b19-7c91-2f9fae512663"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    OverscriptBox[
     StyleBox["X", "TI"], "_"], 
    OverscriptBox[
     StyleBox["Z", "TI"], "_"], "\[LongEqual]", 
    StyleBox["i", "TI"], " ", 
    SuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["Y", "TI"], 
     RowBox[{"\[CircleTimes]", "7"}]]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "6334ac9c-43f1-85c0-12cb-45c67585ef2a"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    OverscriptBox[
     StyleBox["Y", "TI"], "_"], "\[LongEqual]", 
    StyleBox["i", "TI"], 
    OverscriptBox[
     StyleBox["X", "TI"], "_"], 
    OverscriptBox[
     StyleBox["Z", "TI"], "_"]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "74397683-04f4-1d4d-1dc7-6fedac816797"],
 ", so ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["Y", "TI"], 
     RowBox[{"\[CircleTimes]", "7"}]], "\[LongEqual]", "-", 
    OverscriptBox[
     StyleBox["Y", "TI"], "_"]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "735e49d5-32a1-4a48-2166-609f47541892"],
 " (eq. 11.22). Everywhere else in this layer a conjugation modulo sign is \
enough; here the sign ",
 StyleBox["is", "TI"],
 " the answer, so this object carries the ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["Z",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], "4"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "335d55a2-cf9b-493d-6163-4c0fea2e1807"],
 " phase through every step and asks membership of a routine that knows a \
generator's true phase."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"3bfbbd45-edb8-1b0b-6998-352e844d6651"],

Cell["\<\
Being a gate gadget at all is the other half, and it is reported generator by \
generator rather than as one boolean, because the interesting failures are \
partial:\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"045023ab-c37d-b770-2c6f-baf4f6091a5a"],

