     "615fadf7-df9a-5675-1764-44b0da2f3d5f"], Cell[
    "a code and a number of blocks", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->
     "5de452e3-5fd7-a751-0b9c-4bcd5a630dbb"], Cell["\<\
the layout, the lift, the transversal CNOT and what it does logically\
\>", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"2d0df906-1ebb-1081-5b32-f1609b4e62eb"], 
    Cell["making a logical qubit addressable", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->
     "519a4e0d-3467-bfb9-07ba-6057bd130583"]},
   {Cell[TextData[Cell[BoxData[
     RowBox[{"QECTransversalGate", "[", 
      RowBox[{"code", ",", " ", "gate"}], "]"}]], "InlineFormula",
     FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
     "3a891815-8c00-cf41-6ab6-925f25ba95ab"]], "TableText",ExpressionUUID->
     "0dbacffa-31b0-43f6-3b59-e6a4404511dc"], Cell[TextData[{
     "a code and a gate, a sequence of gates, or ",
     Cell[BoxData["All"], "InlineFormula",
      FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
      "196a859c-b643-c1b3-4f69-1cd9c3f79399"]
    }], "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"48c8a383-1e42-ef31-78f7-3aed9bf4b21b"], 
    Cell["\<\
whether it is a gadget, the images of the generators, the logical action and \
its name\
\>", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"50735439-04fd-dee7-0001-4e63ac89a4cd"], 
    Cell["knowing which logical gate you actually performed", "TableText",
     ExpressionUUID->"3597ba8d-914b-928f-63ac-33d720ffe0d5"]},
   {Cell[TextData[Cell[BoxData[
     RowBox[{"QECFaultTolerantCircuit", "[", 
      RowBox[{"circuit", ",", " ", "code"}], "]"}]], "InlineFormula",
     FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
     "056fda38-a5bc-2884-3314-dc65cc497aee"]], "TableText",ExpressionUUID->
     "383c4a9f-130c-f8c1-69c4-63d9a6beca2b"], Cell[TextData[{
     "an ideal Clifford circuit on logical qubits, and a CSS code; options ",
     Cell[BoxData["\"\<Order\>\""], "InlineFormula",
      FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
      "7b649e79-a2e1-7610-291b-1022d6945d7a"],
     ", ",
     Cell[BoxData["\"\<Ancilla\>\""], "InlineFormula",
      FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
      "09cb884c-5fc8-b209-3fc8-22165a620153"]
    }], "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"376c6589-bcca-29e8-5d14-7cd3357f7b32"], 
    Cell[TextData[{
     Cell[BoxData[
      FormBox[
       RowBox[{
        StyleBox["F", "TI"], 
        StyleBox["T", "TI"], 
        RowBox[{"(", 
         StyleBox["C", "TI"], ")"}]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
      FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
      "667bb688-7420-22c7-0e18-2fd27dd5702d"],
     ", its gadget table, its readouts, its herald checks, and the three \
overheads"
    }], "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"72002252-da4c-5210-223f-c41fdff9217a"], 
    Cell["turning a circuit into its fault-tolerant simulation", "TableText",
     ExpressionUUID->"084561a7-5440-aaee-387b-78015dfaf834"]},
   {Cell[TextData[Cell[BoxData[
     RowBox[{"QECExtendedRectangle", "[", 
      RowBox[{"code", ",", " ", "location"}], "]"}]], "InlineFormula",
     FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
     "721e71e5-9ca7-ded5-2226-68cf1553a43f"]], "TableText",ExpressionUUID->
     "0a84e7eb-55e0-1894-3abb-feb563956afe"], Cell[TextData[{
     "a CSS code and a location: ",
     Cell[BoxData["\"\<Preparation\>\""], "InlineFormula",
      FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
      "3261920b-7b77-02d6-621e-14557e02503c"],
     ", ",
     Cell[BoxData["\"\<Measurement\>\""], "InlineFormula",
      FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
      "4ebe3b2c-9c8f-bd2d-7645-b376153b0477"],
     ", ",
     Cell[BoxData["\"\<Wait\>\""], "InlineFormula",
      FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
      "7d6a0058-fb4a-caff-2b69-9a05fefc98c5"],
     ", a one-qubit Clifford, ",
     Cell[BoxData["\"\<CNOT\>\""], "InlineFormula",
      FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
      "41d92934-9aba-8299-77e6-c17e1f4cd0e3"],
     ", or ",
     Cell[BoxData["\"\<T\>\""], "InlineFormula",
      FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
      "5cc23ff5-bf0f-f019-04f1-b6bf3abbc363"],
     " (by magic-state injection)"
    }], "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"29880975-91f0-008f-5fb7-a13f278552d5"], 
    Cell["\<\
the exRec's locations by type, its post-selections, the bad-set bound, the \
malignant pairs and their bound\
\>", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"551c00cf-fc58-99c4-0323-99a8f5d2eb2e"], 
    Cell["the threshold theorem's unit of proof, counted", "TableText",
     ExpressionUUID->"22235db8-54be-42b7-53d1-54e25d4b109d"]}
  },
